Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:46.19,Hook,,0,0,0,,¡GATA, NO, POR FAVOR!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Verde, el Sonic verde no\Nse está…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.98,0:00:08.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Vámonos, vamos, fuga!\NVoladora… gata…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.14,0:00:10.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}No, por favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.34,0:00:11.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Gata…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.66,0:00:15.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Gata, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.67,0:00:22.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}No, no es cierto. Dime que\Nno es cierto. ¡Ey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.75,0:00:26.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Ey, ey, gata, muévete!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.71,0:00:29.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Ya, ya se movió, se movió.\NVamos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.29,0:00:34.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Una neurona, güey. Ocho\Ncabrones, una neurona.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.37,0:00:38.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}No son…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.15,0:00:46.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¡Fue Tails! Todos vieron\Nque fue Tails. Regresen.
